{"recordId":"emperor_楚宣王_281021829","name":"楚宣王","type":"emperor","dynasty":"戰國","title":"南楚霸主","canonicalName":null,"aliases":[],"identityStatus":"candidate","candidatePages":[{"title":"楚宣王","pageId":335214,"revisionId":91206031,"revisionTimestamp":"2026-01-22T05:50:26Z","url":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E6%A5%9A%E5%AE%A3%E7%8E%8B","revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=91206031","wikidataId":"Q795965","isDisambiguation":false,"bibliography":[{"citationTitle":"史记·卷四十·楚世家第十","url":null,"type":"named-work","locator":"reference or bibliography section"},{"citationTitle":"战国策·卷十四·楚策一","url":null,"type":"named-work","locator":"reference or bibliography section"}],"wikisourceLinks":[],"retrievedAt":"2026-10-02T10:40:01.019Z","attribution":{"source":"Chinese Wikipedia contributors","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0; bibliography metadata only","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","status":"candidate index, not independently verified evidence"}}],"sourceIds":["source:shiji","source:hanshu","source:houhanshu","source:zizhitongjian"],"reviewIds":[],"claimIds":[],"matches":[{"documentId":"document:shiji-e84af86b4cc75f1f","query":"楚宣王","count":1,"offset":5280,"excerpt":"十六。民大疫。日蝕。\n二。敗韓馬陵。\n二。魏敗我馬陵。\n六。敗魏涿澤，圍惠王。\n楚宣王良夫元年\n四\n十。宋剔成元年。\n\n368\n顯王元年。\n十七。櫟陽雨金，四月至八月。\n三。齊伐我觀。\n三\n七。侵齊，至長城。\n二\n五\n十一。伐魏取觀。趙侵我長城。","matchType":"name-occurrence"},{"documentId":"document:shiji-5767cab9d7cbed26","query":"楚宣王","count":1,"offset":7808,"excerpt":"捍關以距之。十年，魏取我魯陽。十一年，肅王卒，無子，立其弟熊良夫，是爲宣王。\n\n楚宣王\n\n宣王六年，周天子賀秦獻公。秦始復彊，而三晉益大，魏惠王、齊威王尤彊。三十年，秦封衞鞅於商，南侵楚。是年，宣王卒，子威王熊商立。\n\n楚威王\n\n威王六年，周顯王","matchType":"name-occurrence"},{"documentId":"document:hanshu-eb969eba8b9bb8ea","query":"楚宣王","count":1,"offset":20649,"excerpt":"扁音篇。」〕\n|\n\n　　　屈宜咎　被雍　安陵繵〔師古曰：「繵即纏字也。」〕\n| 楚宣王〔肅王子。〕\n|　\n\n　　　鐸椒　昭奚恤　　　　\n\n　　　鄚敖子華　江乙　蘇秦　　宋剔成君〔辟公子。〕\n|\n\n　　　　沈尹華　張儀　魯康公　　\n\n　　　史舉　　","matchType":"name-occurrence"},{"documentId":"document:houhanshu-3ae8f4f099537447","query":"楚宣王","count":1,"offset":7511,"excerpt":"名，屬東海國，故城在今沂州承縣西南。\n\n注[二]縣名，屬彭城國，本春秋時偪陽也。楚宣王滅宋，改曰傅陽，故城在今沂州承縣南。\n\n注[三]取慮音秋閭，縣名，屬下邳郡，故城在今泗州下邳縣西南。雎陵，縣，在下邳縣東南。夏丘，縣，屬沛郡，故城今泗州虹縣是。","matchType":"name-occurrence"},{"documentId":"document:zizhitongjian-2ad553a3b5b81692","query":"楚宣王","count":3,"offset":4490,"excerpt":"不知也。何者？以王好聞人之美而惡聞人之惡也。」王曰：「善！寡人願兩聞之。」\n\n〔楚宣王嘗問群臣曰：「吾聞北方之畏昭奚恤也，果誠何如？」群臣莫對。江乙對曰：「虎求百獸而食之，得狐。狐曰：『子無敢食我也。天帝使我長百獸，今子食我，是逆天帝命也。子以我","matchType":"name-occurrence"}],"matchCount":5,"gaps":["身份連結尚未完成編輯核對；同名、異名或同時代關係可能有誤配。","原人物分析及能力數值尚未逐句核對。","來源中的年代、關係與評價仍需逐條轉成有出處的主張。"],"notes":["姓名／重新導向命中，人物身份與每條書目尚須逐項核對。","姓名、分類、時代及稱號保留原庫資料，不自動視為史實。"],"version":"b66c5a60a41e2334","matchedDocuments":[{"id":"document:shiji-e84af86b4cc75f1f","bookId":"book:shiji","requestedTitle":"史記/卷015","title":"史記/卷015","sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikisource.org/wiki/%E5%8F%B2%E8%A8%98%2F%E5%8D%B7015","revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikisource.org/w/index.php?oldid=2607002","historyUrl":"https://zh.wikisource.org/wiki/%E5%8F%B2%E8%A8%98%2F%E5%8D%B7015?action=history","revisionId":2607002,"revisionTimestamp":"2025-10-16T05:13:38Z","retrievedAt":"2026-10-02T10:34:02.351Z","sha256":"d3559a5421ece71e5aac57bef193258b320f32f2934cba97874d35eb02b64f6d","textSha256":"f7595dc70ca1955e9ac29c83cb4fab291ceea245c3ac5a3660ef5492a018976d","expandedWikitextSha256":"d3559a5421ece71e5aac57bef193258b320f32f2934cba97874d35eb02b64f6d","characters":14248,"contentPath":"/static/data/history/archive-books/shiji.json","status":"downloaded","acquisitionStatus":"downloaded","reuse":"Ancient underlying text; Wikisource transcription attribution and CC BY-SA 4.0 for applicable contributions","extraction":"wikitext-conservative-v2.1.0","normalizedAt":"2026-10-02T11:14:35.071Z","upstreamTextQuality":null,"upstreamTextQualityMeaning":"Wikisource platform quality marker; not a percentage of text transcribed","textCompleteness":"not-independently-collated","extractionNotes":[],"expandedTransclusionTitles":[],"transclusionIssues":[],"transclusions":[],"textPath":"/stat